OL,3,GNEWSAAll-day free parking offered for
OL,4,AChristmas event
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll-day free parking is being offered
OL,7,Fat some council car parks so people can
OL,8,Fenjoy an upcoming Christmas event.
OL,10,FTunbridge Wells Borough Council is
OL,11,Foffering free parking at its car parks
OL,12,Fat Royal Victoria Place, Town Hall,
OL,13,FGreat Hall, Meadow Road, Torrington,
OL,14,FThe Pantiles, and Linden Park Road on
OL,15,FSaturday 14 November for the Christmas
OL,16,FKick Off event.
OL,18,FThe event is expected to bring
OL,19,Fthousands of people to the town, the
OL,20,Fcouncil says.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
