OL,3,GNEWSAAll-day free parking offered for
OL,4,AChristmas event
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Rob Wormington said: "By
OL,7,Foffering free parking throughout the
OL,8,Fday, we're making it easier for
OL,9,Fresidents and visitors to enjoy the
OL,10,Fcelebrations, discover everything our
OL,11,Ftown has to offer and support local
OL,12,Fbusinesses at an important time of
OL,13,Fyear."
